    "A nudge before each step in your plan. Reminders are scheduled on this phone, so they arrive without a connection. Each device has its own setting.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A nudge before each step in your plan. Reminders are scheduled on this phone, so they arrive without a connection. Each device has its own setting."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een seintje voor elke stap in je plan. Herinneringen worden op deze telefoon ingepland, dus ze komen ook zonder verbinding aan. Elk apparaat heeft een eigen instelling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminders are off. When you turn them on, your phone asks once whether ChronoFlow may send notifications.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reminders are off. When you turn them on, your phone asks once whether ChronoFlow may send notifications."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Herinneringen staan uit. Als je ze aanzet, vraagt je telefoon één keer of ChronoFlow meldingen mag sturen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on reminders": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
